; the program: the game of src/game, drawn by src/render, run by the
; Playground (MiniSoldat.ml).
;
; Drawn on one of the Playground's native platforms, SDL for the window
; either way: Cairo's (elm_playground_native) or its own rasterizer
; (elm_playground_software). The platform is a virtual library, one
; implementation linked into an executable, so the choice is made when
; linking: mini-soldat takes Cairo's when it is installed, else the
; software one (the select below, which links the libraries of the
; first alternative available; Platform_choice says which), and
; software/'s mini-soldat-software is always the software one.
; ./configure --software, or no Cairo, leaves elm_playground_native out.
(executable
 (name MiniSoldat)
 (public_name mini-soldat)
 (libraries
   tiny_libs.core ; Program
   soldat_game soldat_render
   elm_playground
   (select Platform_choice.ml from
     (elm_playground_native -> Platform_choice.cairo.ml) ; SDL and Cairo
     (elm_playground_software -> Platform_choice.software.ml)))) ; SDL and our own rasterizer
